        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Thumb Lift Handleset for Global Series TH1100EDTBAR</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Entry Function (with thumb lift) Handleset (key locks and unlocks thumb lift) for Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200r\"><b>PDQ 4200 Rim Exit Device</b></a> and other manufactures <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Devices</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with lock cylinder, mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Global TH1100-TPED-AL Thumb Lift  Handleset \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Entry - Key locks and unlocks the thumb lift. When unlocked pushing the thumb lift down unlatches the exit device for opening door from exterior.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Height: 12-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with Schlage \"C\" Keyway Lock Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
